<title>ITALY: Cariplo H1 1996 net profit up 5.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Cariplo H1 1996 net profit up 5.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>Parent company results</p>
<p>    Net profit		    172  vs  up   5.9 pct</p>
<p>    Gross profit		  355  vs  up   0.4 pct</p>
<p>    Gross margin		  988  vs  up  19.9 pct</p>
<p>    Loans		     117,714  vs  up   1.8 pct</p>
<p>    Deposits		   74,614  vs  up   5.4 pct</p>
<p>    Net interest income     1,595  vs  down 0.5 pct</p>
<p>    Operating income	  2,295  vs  up   9.6 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Cariplo is a Milan-based savings bank.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
